t biplane and for the  last earthbound thrill rev your engine  at exotics racing in Los Angeles there  you can hop inside a Ferrari  ragini are Aston Martin and blaze around  the racetrack without having to worry  about pesky traffic lights or speed  limits that concludes the death-defying  adventure tour of california once you've  slept off the exhaustion you may need a  calming trip to wine country
 

